nd aliens ferrei finds work  with the delivery crew of planet express  which takes him across the galaxy on a  series of bizarre adventures  more than anything else futurama is  crass clever and genuinely hilarious  honey we love you sure baby i knew it  thing is futurama also had the ability  to slip around your defenses and  actually make you feel something  fans still reference the episode's  jurassic park and the luck of the  frirish with reverence and  awe and its finale might have been the  show's crowning achievement in meanwhile  fry's misuse of a time reverting button  designed by professor farnsworth results  in the world being frozen  except for himself and leela this allows  the two to grow old  together and alone in the end a  malfunction results in  all the events of the entire show thus  far being reset  as fry and leela agreed to go around one  more time  when the finale first aired comedy  central aired the pilot episode again  immediately after which begs the  question did futurama  even end it's been repeatedly noted by  fans and critics alike that mash lasted  far longer than the actual korean war  nonetheless it still felt hard to say  goodbye when the 11 season ratings  behemoth finally bid ado  in 1983. the final episode appropriately  entitled goodbye farewell and  amen depicts the final days of the  korean war through the eyes of its main  cast  in the end a ceasefire is declared and  the group throws a final party  the next day after klinger and soon  lee's marriage everyone says their final  goodbyes and departs for home  the episode was nominated for a whole  heap of emmys and golden globes but more  importantly it had the approval of the  masses too  bringing in a jaw-dropping 121.6 million  viewers beating out that year's super  bowl  goodbye farewell and amen remains one of  the most watched broadcasts in the  history of television  many shows are remembered more for their  finales than for anything else but  that's usually because  things have gone very wrong indeed not  so for six feet under however  which follows the fisher family and  their los angeles funeral home in the  tumultuous years after the death of the  family patriarch  the show itself was acclaimed for its  writing and acting throughout its run  but the finale is most fondly remembered  as one of the finest in television  history  the final episode everyone's waiting  bucks series tradition by  opening with a birth rather than a death  brenda and the late nate's daughter  willa is eight weeks premature and the  doctor tells her all they can do is hope  for the best  after checking in with all the surviving  characters the episode's final sequence  flashes forward to the deaths of the  entire main cast as claire  drives away from her family home to  begin a new life in new york  it's a beautiful chilling montage that  was totally unexpected when the episode  first aired  in hindsight though it feels like the  only satisfying way to end such a  macabre and groundbreaking show  it seems fitting that the show that came  closest to true perfection would be the  one to best stick its landing  it's also worth noting that few people  really knew how breaking bad was going  to end  that a show could keep such a passionate  fan base guessing right up until the  last moments is a testament to the  impeccable vision of showrunner vince  gilligan  probably an even bigger question than  how walter white's story would end was  what kind of catharsis if any he'd be  permitted  after all walt was both the show's main  character and its most soulless villain  in the end though he got exactly what he  wanted a chance to see his family one  last time  a last minute rescue for jesse vengeance  for the death of hank and one last  moment with his true love  a meth lab having been wounded in a  gunfight moments earlier walt collapses  onto the floor of the lab as the police  close in  undone by his own machinations but  satisfied with how he went out  it's more or less the perfect ending and  few shows have managed to match it since  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

